# Auto-deploy to live VPS

When you finish a change set that should go live on `www.sellerbunker.com`:

1. Commit (only if the user asked to commit, or they already asked for auto-ship / deploy-without-asking in this thread).
2. Push to the working branch (`startup-edits` unless told otherwise).
3. **Deploy without waiting to be asked:** run `bash scripts/vps-deploy-from-agent.sh` from the repo root.
4. Tell the user live is updating / done — do not ask “want me to deploy?”

Skip deploy only for pure docs/rules, unanswered local experiments, or when the user explicitly says not to deploy.
